# Domain Search System (.NZ)
# Purpose: runtime logic specification for the PlanetBintang global search.
# Live browser implementation: ../search-page.js
# Data source: ../data/domain-registry.nz plus available al.l data.media domain shards.
# Internet results use the public Wikipedia API; Google Search remains available as an external search link.
# Records must be one JSON object per line: {"domain":"example.tld","status":"source/status"}
# Never label an unverified domain as live, registered, or reachable.
